 ('c0539','la-metal','Queen Millennia','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queen_Millennia','Wikipedia contributors','La-Metal’s monarchy plans to abduct and enslave Earth humans.','needs_evidence','La-Metal’s power and enslavement plan do not specify its actual automatic production or civilian allocation.','Biological rulers are not AI, and planned capture is not an implemented post-work society.'),
 ('c0541','arcadia','Arcadia of My Youth: Endless Orbit SSX','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arcadia_of_My_Youth%3A_Endless_Orbit_SSX','Wikipedia contributors','Illumidas occupation uses biological domination and slavery after the film’s events.','boundary_case','Occupation, ration scarcity and biological domination do not establish automatic post-work material provision.','A hoped-for peace planet is not a realized economy; this continuity is not the complacent 1978 Earth.'),
